#: src/libs/orpc/ai-consent.ts
msgid "Shares resume, posting and pasted questions. Answer drafts also use your letter, career preferences, application notes and contacts, and enabled Knowledge facts and stories. Context may be excerpted. Web access is off. Review before saving; nothing is submitted."
